id: renderer
name: Renderer packages
description: Verify renderer definitions and sealed preview declarations.
types:
  - ext: .renderer
  - ext: .renderer_example
guidance: |
  Write renderer code first and its definition last. Entrypoints and imports stay
  in the package. Export defineRenderer({ component }); use inline styles in
  shadow DOM. A preview names an existing renderer definition and sample file.
examples:
  - folder: basic
    description: A native component and its renderer definition.
    expect: valid
    feedback: The entrypoint exports a statically readable renderer definition.
derived: 1c00456d5ff3086a5bde3de8d2c622b8f06ff084cd4dcb8bec0ac395b83b0323
